## Chat co-pilot pattern (inspiration, no vendored code)

Jarvis mode's judge → draft-3 → rank → fill-only interaction pattern was
inspired by:

- **jev-chat-jarvis** — https://github.com/jev-chat/jev-chat-jarvis (MIT License)

No source from that project is vendored in this repository: judge questions,
